    "frames": [
      {
        "slide": 1,
        "role": "cover",
        "subject": "a pale fixed-wing delivery aircraft with faired booms, lathe nacelles, a V tail and glowing nav lights, a banded finless pod on a short tether below it, high over a town's street-lamp grid at night",
        "visual_consequence": "With the headline covered, the frame reads as a delivery aircraft already carrying a parcel at height over a town. The denser lamp grid now reads as rows of streets converging on the horizon and running diagonally below, so the aircraft's height over Round Rock registers without the dek.",
        "weakness": "None blocking. With the fins gone, the pod reads as one clean turned shell with a wrapped band (r3c1 at x 928 to 1080, y 190 to 630, and r3c2 at x 0 to 123, y 190 to 630). Remaining minor items at native size: the band's shading range is still narrower than the shell's, a faint residual pusher arc shows below the tail (r2c2 at x 170 to 430, y 800 to 900), and the wing pylons are short plain fairings (r2c1 at x 605 to 720, y 715 to 745). None of these changes the reading at 432 px.",
